  <div class="l prose" data-reveal>
    <h2 id="story-h" class="sr-only">My story</h2>
    <p class="bigtext">I started making this during the pandemic. It was a scary time for a lot of people, and <span class="hl">it hit me too.</span></p>
    <p>It wasn't just COVID. I'd left corporate to start my own business. A year before the pandemic, my family went through a tragic loss. So much was changing at once, and I couldn't find the words for any of it.</p>
    <p>I kept hoping somebody would say something. Some hope, some motivation, anything that felt like a way out. It never came.</p>
    <p>So I started saying those words to myself. Then I started posting them. And it was clear it wasn't just me who needed them.</p>
    <p>There are a lot of people out there who can't find the words for what they're going through. I couldn't either, until I eventually found them. <strong>So I decided to be that voice.</strong></p>
  </div>
